Third-party services / credentials

This license covers the ia-flow source code only. It grants no rights to, and
bundles no credentials for, any third-party service the software can talk to.

In particular, using the `anthropic-api` provider requires you to supply your
own Anthropic credential — the `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` environment variable (or
`CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN`). ia-flow ships no API key: requests are made with
yours, billed to your Anthropic account, and are subject to Anthropic's own
terms of service and usage policies. The same applies to the credentials for
GitHub, Slack and Figma that the software may be configured to use.
